          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of તડકો (taḍko) is not settled. CDIAL lists no Gujarati form like it; its nearest entry, Sanskrit tāpa, \"heat\", gives Old Gujarati tāvaḍu, \"heat of the sun\", but no link to taḍko is made there (CDIAL 5767)."
            }
